{
    "article_summary": "The article describes the first ruthenium(II)-catalyzed chemoselective deacylative annulation of 1,3-diones with sulfoxonium ylides. This method utilizes C-C bond activation of unstrained 1,3-diones to generate alkyl Ru(II) intermediates, which then react with sulfoxonium ylides to produce substituted furans with high chemoselectivity and broad substrate scope.",
